{
  "_comment": [
    "Layer in front of the base replies:",
    "    --replies resources/replies-ungrounded.json --replies ../02-.../resources/replies.json",
    "",
    "One character is wrong. The span cites `CHF 18,400` where PLAY-1001 writes",
    "`CHF 18'400`, so the span cannot be located in the document and the field is",
    "ungrounded (R6.4). The value is exactly right and gold agrees with it -- and it",
    "is still scored incorrect (R7.4), because a value that happens to be right is",
    "not evidence.",
    "",
    "Grounding normalises whitespace on both sides, so a span broken across two",
    "lines in the document still matches. It does not normalise anything else: an",
    "apostrophe is not a comma, and case is compared exactly."
  ],
  "rules": [
    {
      "match": ["# PLAY-1001"],
      "reply": {
        "document": "PLAY-1001.md",
        "fields": [
          {
            "field": "loss_amount",
            "value": 18400.0,
            "currency": "CHF",
            "confidence": "high",
            "source": {"document": "PLAY-1001.md", "span": "a recorded loss of CHF 18,400"}
          },
          {
            "field": "resolution_date",
            "value": "2026-03-04",
            "confidence": "high",
            "source": {"document": "PLAY-1001.md", "span": "**Resolved:** 2026-03-04"}
          },
          {
            "field": "severity",
            "value": "major",
            "confidence": "high",
            "source": {"document": "PLAY-1001.md", "span": "**Severity:** major"}
          },
          {
            "field": "affected_systems",
            "value": "checkout-api, payments-gateway",
            "confidence": "high",
            "source": {
              "document": "PLAY-1001.md",
              "span": "**Systems affected:** checkout-api, payments-gateway"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
